The Architecture Decision Record has no scoring, grading, or validation
engine by design: it is a documentation form (Tyree & Akerman ADR template)
whose only derived logic is the DOM-level required-field check in
form-app.js's validateForm(). The workflow status (pending / proposed /
accepted / superseded ...) is entered, not computed.

bin/test-engines reports this form as NONE rather than SKIP.
